direction: down
classes: {
  core: {
    style.stroke: "#2563eb"
    style.bold: true
  }
}

Total Quota: capacity budget (total_quota)
Total Quota -> Error Calc

Error Calc: Error = total_quota - quota_sum {
  shape: diamond
}

Error Calc -> PID Controller
PID Controller: PID {
  class: core
}

PID Controller -> Base Quota
Base Quota: base quota

Base Quota -> Clamp
Clamp: clamp(min, max)

Clamp -> Next Requests
Next Requests: future requests

Next Requests -> Quota Sum
Quota Sum: quota_sum (Redis) {
  shape: cylinder
  style.stroke: "#16a34a"
}

Quota Sum -> Error Calc: Feedback Loop {
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}
